{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to data/models.json. `model_id` is the identity: it goes in the",
    "request body, it is what the UI stores on every verdict, and renaming it",
    "strands existing measurements. `model_title` is display only and is safe",
    "to change at any time.",
    "",
    "Each model carries its own endpoint and its own key, so one run can reach",
    "several providers. Keep this file under ./data — that is the directory",
    "compose mounts into the container, and a path outside it resolves on the",
    "host and vanishes in Docker."
  ],
  "models": [
    { "model_title": "GPT-4o",     "model_id": "gpt-4o",
      "api_key": "sk-...",         "v1_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1" },
    { "model_title": "Local Qwen", "model_id": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct",
      "api_key": "not-needed",     "v1_endpoint": "http://localhost:8001/v1" }
  ]
}
